        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7814, Traditional Rope Cabinet Pull Backplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International's Rope Cabinet Pull Rose features a classic style with a modern shape. It is sure to bring the traditional rope design in to the modern age. It can be used with the matching <a href=\"/products/rope-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-1617\">Rope Cabinet Pull</a> or with something a little more modern like the <a href=\"/products/contemporary-curve-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-09\">Contemporary Curve Cabinet Pull</a>. In fact, it's great for almost any cabinet pull with a 3 inch center to center or a 3-1/2 center to center depending on which of the two size rosettes you choose. The Traditional Rope Cabinet Pull Backplate is available in 8 finishes including polished brass, polished chrome, and satin nickel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-BP-7814:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For use with cabinet pulls with a 3 inch c.c</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-BP-7813:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For use with cabinet pulls with a 3-1/2 inch c.c</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
